Screenshots are not currently included in the repository. The most useful additions would be:

1. Dashboard with prioritized topics and upcoming sessions.
2. Upload page showing indexed PDF results.
3. Chat page showing a retrieval-grounded answer.
4. Quiz page showing generated questions and feedback.
5. Flashcards or Schedule page showing the active learning workflow.

